        "body": "Choose exactly one primary_contribution in {methods_sensitivity, validation, regional_evidence}. List ≥3 prior_study_themes. State one claim you will not make. Run unit_8_7_paper_readiness_check.py mentally: multiple primaries and synthetic-as-field are rejected."
